      "message": "Debian seems to symlink /usr/lib/\u003cproject\u003e in /usr/lib/cmake, though I only have various libclang/llvm-dev packages installed.\n\nWe had discussed other variants [1] in another change I think, I\u0027m somewhat ambivalent if they\u0027re all supported, though `\u003cprefix\u003e/(lib/\u003carch\u003e|lib*|share)/cmake` does appear earlier in the search list.\n\n[1] https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/command/find_package.html#search-procedure",
